 and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).
 
 ## [Unreleased]
+
+- **Keep incremental enum publication responsive.** Incremental class-cache population remains on the AST merge-lock owner so lazy builtin or vendor class parsing can safely reenter publication. Startup population remains parallel. Contributed by @thinkycz.
 
 - **Honor locally available route classes.** Prior unconditional class and enum declarations can select invokable class actions over same-named controller-group methods, independently of PHP imports. Namespace-dependent targets retain navigation and incomplete metadata while refusing partial class renames. Deferred scopes and top-level goto flow do not supply declaration-order proofs. Contributed by @thinkycz.
 
